      "writtenOn": "2018-05-23T17:36:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unfortunately, the way these settings are organized, the order here is very important. L17 is responsible for selecting a logical device i.e. KBC in this case and all the settings that follow are applied on that logical device. Thus L18-L22 are all meant for KBC logical device. L23 selects a different logical device.",
